      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report on a 44-year-old male patient with zosteriform leiomyomatosis on his right back (paravertebral Th 10-L2), who suffered from severe pain, especially after thermal or pressure irritation, in this area. Treatment with iontophoresis using tap water resulted in a gradual relief from the pain."},
